Comment: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:25.75,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}In deep blue dreams again and again,
Comment: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:32.22,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}the unknown sky stretches on, boundless
Comment: 0,0:00:32.29,0:00:38.25,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Surely I kept searching, feeling your gaze,
Comment: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:45.16,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}fumbling onward just to meet you
Comment: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:50.81,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}In lonely nights you drew close,
Comment: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:57.68,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}the hand you reached out, that warmth I held
Comment: 0,0:00:57.97,0:01:04.21,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A gentle kiss wraps my feelings,
Comment: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:10.35,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}in our joined hearts, your tears remain
Comment: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:19.01,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}When wishes are granted, the light will guide us, taking flight...
Comment: 0,0:01:19.13,0:01:21.69,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}...into the blue sky
Comment: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:51.32,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Even if certain dreams fade from my hand,
Comment: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:57.20,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I still want to stay like this with you
Comment: 0,0:01:57.58,0:02:03.81,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A gentle kiss wraps my feelings,
Comment: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:10.00,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}in our joined hearts, your tears remain
Comment: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:18.37,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}When wishes come true, the light will guide us, departing...
Comment: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:22.25,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}...into the blue sky
